{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE FINAL BOSS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/e1507de5dc6091dec4c542afdade7cbe.poster.avif?t=1758893448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/e1507de5dc6091dec4c542afdade7cbe.webm?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/e1507de5dc6091dec4c542afdade7cbe.mp4?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BECOME THE FINAL BOSS</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena roguelike inspired by\u00a0<strong>Brotato</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>The Binding of Isaac</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the Final Boss of a MMORPG</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your Dungeon Boss from a huge, unique roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls, Upgrade, Equip tons of silly Attacks and get Overpowered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick and Addictive Runs</strong>\u00a0(under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replay value</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/678cc7f3532f0590976f3f835ed370cd.poster.avif?t=1758893448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/678cc7f3532f0590976f3f835ed370cd.webm?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/678cc7f3532f0590976f3f835ed370cd.mp4?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EACH RUN IS UNIQUE</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your build from a wide variety of creative and innovative mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip boss attack patterns, summon minions, swing physics-based chain spikeballs, and kick wrecking balls (and play soccer with your minions or co-op partners!). Wield guns, grow plant minions with a watering can, transform enemies into sheep or golden statues (or both?), mine ore, deploy turrets and tons of other weapons with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Theorycrafting &amp; Emergent Gameplay</strong>:\u00a0Discover unique synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Game</strong>: Push your <strong>Amount</strong> or <strong>Size</strong> stats to absurd levels and watch the screen explode in chaos! Use the <strong>Cheater</strong> Item to stack unique items multiple times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/b2d71348e40da153a181da64e32de56f.poster.avif?t=1758893448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/b2d71348e40da153a181da64e32de56f.webm?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/b2d71348e40da153a181da64e32de56f.mp4?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TONS OF CONTENT AND UNLOCKS</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 Playable Characters</strong> with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of items and weapons</strong> to choose from (Boss Patterns, Minions, Watercan etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinite amount of synergies</strong> and combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</strong>\u00a0(Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 players Local Co-op Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>110+ in-game quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Difficulties + Endless Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and Badass artstyle +\u00a0<strong>Banger OST</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parody RPG Universe, meta humor and funny cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch Streamer Mode\u00a0(noobs takes usernames and messages from chat)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/19e5bd1c757d671ca5c9f4556e2f6245.poster.avif?t=1758893448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/19e5bd1c757d671ca5c9f4556e2f6245.webm?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/19e5bd1c757d671ca5c9f4556e2f6245.mp4?t=1758893448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOOBS ARE COMING!</strong> <strong>Show them who's the boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/22bde457e711a40e790b11ee25bad29c.poster.avif?t=1758893448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as